1138
01:05:24.358 --> 01:05:25.233
It’s an intersection at the entrance to a residential area.

1139
01:05:25.317 --> 01:05:26.818
យើងក៏ជិតនៅទីនោះដែរ។

1140
01:05:28.028 --> 01:05:28.862
តើវាជាអ្វី

1141
01:05:30.238 --> 01:05:31.198
បុរស

1142
01:05:35.077 --> 01:05:36.203
